  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Logistical Support to the Swiss Election Observer Group to the EU Election Observation Mission (&#x201c;EU EOM&#x201d;) for the General Elections in Nigeria - 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Commission/FPl 3 appointed IOM with the logistical and administrative implementation of the EU EOM Nigeria 2023. In accordance with the terms of reference of the EU EOM Nigeria 2023, IOM will provide logistical and administrative support to one Swiss Election Observer, member of the EU EOM observer group; for this purpose, a separate agreement is signed between IOM and the Swiss Confederation (represented by the Federal Department of Foreign Affairs and acting through the Peace and Human Rights Division, Swiss Expert Pool for Civilian Peacebuilding).</narrative>
  </description>
